---
// Mini Preview: full-bleed-layout（全出血布局）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
// 全宽横幅 + 居中内容容器对比
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
  <div class="rounded-control bg-dark-bg p-3 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 flex-none" style="height: 45%">
    <div class="h-2 w-1/2 rounded-full bg-white/80"></div>
    <div class="h-1.5 w-2/3 rounded-full bg-white/40"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex-1 rounded-control bg-card border border-line p-3 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
    <div class="h-1.5 w-1/3 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
    <div class="flex-1 rounded-md bg-tag-bg"></div>
  </div>
  <p class="text-[10px] text-muted text-center">横幅全宽出血，正文回到居中容器</p>
</div>